erif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">Join us to hear more about the innovations transforming the future of connection, then dive into the details tomorrow with the Developer State of the Union and developer sessions across every platform.</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-20px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">Watch live and see the technologies and tools that will define what you build next. It all starts today at <strong>4:00 PM PT.</strong></p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" class=\"padding-40px-15px-40px-0px button-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:10px 0px 30px 0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDh9AAoAAAAABPe00CXkilwlJynQCTCVqt5aHVFbq0QEPkfPX3j8Mdep2W4Ae3O988QCAw4Kn0rFRJNayiVAqO0EbNvbKmuagm1b5r8EHgJHpV1aj8_V\" target=\"_blank\" width=\"118\" style=\"display:inline-block; width:auto; background:#0064E0; color:#ffffff; font-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2; margin:0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; padding:14px 32px 14px 32px; border-radius:100px; box-sizing:border-box\">Tune in</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"img-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div style=\"margin:0 auto\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"auto\" width=\"800\" src=\"https://client-data.knak.io/production/email_assets/5e501bf6edcaa/sljK6vDA1lc7TQUm7gu88mzppouK6KAwkZV0VfjU.png?utm_source=email:6